1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:09,320
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Arelma and the Swiss accounts, they were the subject of summary judgments po ng Sandiganbayan.

2
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,000
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: So, na-recover na ho iyan.

3
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:17,800
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: And then, as to the other assets po, they became the subject of compromise agreements,

4
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:21,580
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: whereby these assets were surrendered to the government.

5
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Surrendered by whom?

6
00:00:25,057 --> 00:00:26,000
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Surrendered po.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,700
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Iyong mga, those who were, uh, perhaps standing as dummies, they surrendered the, the assets po.

8
00:00:32,759 --> 00:00:35,500
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: So, marami na po tayong recoveries diyan.

9
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:39,080
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: And some of these properties were recovered in other cases po.

10
00:00:39,468 --> 00:00:40,919
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Some but not all.

11
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:55,297
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Well, there are still assets, but, uh, when we investigated po, ano eh, wala na po talagang—for example po, there were corporations listed in that case.

12
00:00:55,640 --> 00:01:00,815
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: But then, these corporations turned out to be unregistered or non-operational na po,

13
00:01:01,304 --> 00:01:03,700
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: and then we don't have anymore the witnesses.

14
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:09,360
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: So, we had to be candid with the court, uh, by stating that we are no longer presenting evidence po.

15
00:01:11,682 --> 00:01:24,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, so, Chair, maaari po bang makahingi sa PCGG ng parang pinaka-report on, uh, the recovered hidden wealth,

16
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:28,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah, especially, ah, iyong mga pinakahuli na nabanggit ninyo?

17
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At mayroon ba tayong imbentaryo?

18
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:34,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ba talaga iyong buong tina-target natin?

19
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,200
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

20
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:40,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ano iyong na-recover na natin at ano iyong hindi pa natin nare-recover?

21
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:42,260
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Mayroon po tayong imbentaryo niyan.

22
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:46,040
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Uh, mayroon din tayong imbentaryo ng current cases po.

23
00:01:46,462 --> 00:01:46,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

24
00:01:47,140 --> 00:01:52,320
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Ah, about, uh, 67 cases po iyan which are pending in the appellate courts.

25
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:54,300
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Ang halaga po niyan,

26
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:55,620
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: mga more than 70

27
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,240
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: billion pa ho.

28
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:58,160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: More than ₱70 billion?

29
00:01:58,561 --> 00:01:58,763
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Oo.

30
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,430
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Ang abogado po namin eh ang OSG po.

31
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:02,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

32
00:02:02,020 --> 00:02:12,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ₱70 billion pa ang tina-target natin na mabawi na ill-gotten wealth ng pamilyang Marcos.

33
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:12,989
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po?

34
00:02:12,989 --> 00:02:13,495
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

35
00:02:13,917 --> 00:02:14,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po.

36
00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:22,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ang PCGG po ay, ah, ano po ba kayo? Attached agency to the—

37
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:25,020
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Attached agency po kami sa Department of Justice.

38
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

39
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kayo po, appointee po kayo?

40
00:02:30,185 --> 00:02:30,573
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

41
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino ang nag-appoint sa inyo?

42
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,460
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Si President Marcos po.

43
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Si President Marcos din.

44
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:35,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

45
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:40,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, well, just your—gusto ko lang po marinig:

46
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po ba awkward sa inyo?

47
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:49,840
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Awkward po, pero trabaho po iyan.

48
00:02:50,570 --> 00:02:51,025
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

49
00:02:51,025 --> 00:02:54,012
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: But then, to the credit of the President

50
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:55,620
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: and the family,

51
00:02:55,640 --> 00:03:00,100
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: we never, uh, uh, were pressured on anything po.

52
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:04,260
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: We have been performing our duty independently.

53
00:03:05,220 --> 00:03:07,580
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: So, wala pong undue influence on us.

54
00:03:08,221 --> 00:03:08,761
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

55
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:19,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, well, so, ang malinaw po, may tina-target pa kayo na ₱70 billion worth of ill-gotten wealth.

56
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:20,500
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

57
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, at may mga pending cases ang mga iyan.

58
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:24,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

59
00:03:24,353 --> 00:03:24,910
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

60
00:03:24,910 --> 00:03:25,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

61
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:32,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya narito kayo ngayon para humingi ng budget para matuloy ninyo pa iyong laban na iyon.

62
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:33,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

63
00:03:34,073 --> 00:03:34,816
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Tama po.

64
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:35,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

65
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:42,260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At, ah, kasi noon, may mga proposal po na i-abolish na raw ang PCGG,

66
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:43,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: no?

67
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:48,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos na raw ang, ang, you know, ang mandato ninyo o wala nang mare-recover.

68
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:50,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sumasang-ayon ba kayo doon?

69
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:54,700
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Ah, kami po eh sang-ayon na ma-abolish iyong PCGG,

70
00:03:54,700 --> 00:04:05,160
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: but in its place, mayroon po sanang maitatayong new agency that will take over the mandate of the PCGG, but expanded mandate po.

71
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:08,880
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Kasi ang mandate po ngayon ng PCGG is napaka-limited po eh.

72
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:11,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's just the Marcos ill-gotten wealth.

73
00:04:12,059 --> 00:04:12,683
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Tama po.

74
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:22,340
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Uh, but then, we want it to be expanded so that, uh, the mandate will be applied to all public officials who have unlawfully acquired assets.

75
00:04:22,589 --> 00:04:23,163
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

76
00:04:23,163 --> 00:04:23,517
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Yes.

77
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:24,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, so, halimbawa,

78
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:27,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig ninyong sabihin iyong mga tipong flood control, ganoon?

79
00:04:28,242 --> 00:04:28,820
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

80
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:37,120
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Ang, ang puwede pong gawin diyan is just to file civil forfeiture cases under RA 1379 po.

81
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:51,500
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Kasi under that law eh nakalagay po doon na any public official who has assets that are manifestly out of proportion to his salary and other legitimate sources of income,

82
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:54,360
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: there is already a presumption po na ill-gotten iyan.

83
00:04:54,700 --> 00:05:05,660
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: And so, the burden of proof shifts to the public official to explain how he was able to amass so much assets, given na this is only salary.

84
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:13,780
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Kaya nga po mapapansin ninyo, iyong, iyong decision po ng Sandiganbayan doon sa Swiss accounts po tsaka Arelma, summary judgment po iyon.

85
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:18,920
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: In other words, it's just based on the pleadings.

86
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,280
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Mahirap ho kasi ang criminal case

87
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:24,600
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: kasi, ang unang-una po, ang quantum of evidence

88
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:26,540
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: is proof beyond reasonable doubt,

89
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:35,420
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: and you have to establish iyong, iyong paper trail to show na iyong asset na iyan came from government funds.

90
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Could you just explain further ano iyong ibig sabihin ng summary judgment?

91
00:05:39,421 --> 00:05:39,826
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Opo.

92
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: By foreign courts?

93
00:05:42,104 --> 00:05:42,695
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Dito po.

94
00:05:42,695 --> 00:05:43,015
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: By local courts.

95
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:46,520
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Sandiganbayan po ang nag-render ng summary judgment.

96
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, okay.

97
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:52,100
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Iyong pong isang summary judgment na iyan, opo, kasama iyong Arelma.

98
00:05:52,100 --> 00:06:01,520
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Ah, the Philippine government filed a petition for forfeiture—ay, for enforcement of foreign judgment po sa New York.

99
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,460
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Eh nanalo po tayo diyan.

100
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,520
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: There was an appeal.

101
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:07,340
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Recently eh lumabas na po iyong decision.

102
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:09,000
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: We won the appeal po.

103
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:19,520
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: So, we are just waiting for the action of the U.S. Supreme Court if they will still, uh, affirm the decision of the Court of Appeals po ng, ano, ng New York.

104
00:06:20,275 --> 00:06:20,647
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

105
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:21,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, Chair,

106
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:26,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, nagpapasalamat po ako sa chair ng PCGG.

107
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:44,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We, we look forward doon sa report, no, iyong kabuuang summary ng mga efforts na ginagawa ng komisyon para ituloy ang laban para bawiin ang ill-gotten wealth ng pamilyang Marcos.

108
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:48,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang sinasabi po rito, may ₱70 billion pa.

109
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:51,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ₱70 billion na kailangang bawiin.

110
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:56,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, we look forward to that report, Mr. Chair,

111
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:56,776
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: thank you.

112
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, po.

113
00:06:57,940 --> 00:06:58,460
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, po.

114
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:01,060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ah, Cong. Tony Tinio?

115
00:07:11,890 --> 00:07:12,230
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Okay.

116
00:07:12,550 --> 00:07:16,510
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: May we recognize Chair Mika Suansing for her manifestation.

117
00:07:24,738 --> 00:07:26,540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Vice Chair Mike.

118
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:32,660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you for presiding over today's deliberation on the budget of the Department of Justice.

119
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:34,659
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you.

120
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:39,060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Iniwan ko po kayo, Sec, kay Vice Chair Mike Tan because you're in very...

121
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:43,940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: You're in very good hands with him and he did so well today in facilitating all the discussions.

122
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much, Vice Chair Mike Tan.

123
00:07:47,039 --> 00:07:51,999
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, I just wanted to, po, wrap up essentially everything that was discussed today.

124
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:56,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I think it all boils down to the budgetary requirements of the DOJ.

125
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:07,260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I was looking through your slides, Sec, and very clear naman that in terms of MOOE, in terms of capital outlay,

126
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ang laki ng binagsak ng budget.

127
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:11,059
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng DOJ.

128
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:16,960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I'm looking at the agency-wise allocations.

129
00:08:22,599 --> 00:08:25,899
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The one that stands out to me is Bureau of Immigration.

130
00:08:26,039 --> 00:08:29,139
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Malaki po talaga yung nawala sa Bureau of Immigration.

131
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:35,580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's not just the capital outlay, the locally funded project, kasi yun po yata yung ICT.

132
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But even the GASS.

133
00:08:38,599 --> 00:08:40,139
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Malaki talaga yung binagsak.

134
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,739
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May I know, po?

135
00:08:42,719 --> 00:08:43,199
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Which...

136
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:46,659
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Specific components of the GASS were reduced.

137
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:50,600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May I have a better idea of what we would need to restore, if ever?

138
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:51,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, po, Your Honor.

139
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,260
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Magandang gabi po, Your Honor.

140
00:08:55,440 --> 00:09:06,780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yung pong sa maintenance and other operating expenses, or MOOE, tinanggalan po kami ng 673,476,000.

141
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,499
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po ang breakdown nun.

142
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:11,319
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Additional provision for a drug-free workplace initiative.

143
00:09:12,279 --> 00:09:12,980
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: In the amount of...

144
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,660
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 3,403,000.

145
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,939
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Additional MOOE for EXPATS.

146
00:09:17,959 --> 00:09:21,019
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung aming expanded alien registration system.

147
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:25,240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Umiikot po yung mga tao po namin sa buong Pilipinas para mag-alien mapping.

148
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:30,940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Tinanggalan po kami ng budget para doon ng 18,871,000.

149
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:39,819
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And then, yun din pong MOOE for locally funded projects for the development, enhancement, and procurement of IT systems and infrastructures.

150
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang amount po niyan is 651,202,000.

151
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:58,300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po, Your Honor, sa capital outlay, tinanggalan rin po kami ng 1,227,811,000.

152
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:06,280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Representing yung pong capital outlay for locally funded projects for the development, enhancement, and procurement of IT systems and infrastructures.

153
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:12,100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung sa aming main office and sa support offices po namin over the Philippines.

154
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:14,440
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang amount po diyan na tinanggal is 951,531,000.

155
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:31,780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And last po, tinanggalan din po kami para sa post-construction ng aming bagong BI building in the amount of 276,280,000.

156
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:40,180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Dati po kasi ma'am, hindi po namin ma-request ito kasi ang sabi po ng DBM, hindi pa po kami nakakalipat sa building.

157
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:42,400
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po, nakalipat na po kami recently.

158
00:10:43,839 --> 00:10:45,379
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, pero po kailangan po namin ng additional funding

159
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:49,702
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Para po sa post-construction, Your Honor.

160
00:10:54,427 --> 00:11:09,619
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kom, I'd have to coordinate with you po because, like for example, just the Bureau of Immigration alone, that's a very substantive amount that would need to be restored if ever.

161
00:11:09,639 --> 00:11:17,439
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, given the limited fiscal space, we'd really have to prioritize which items we would need.

162
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, in the Bureau of Immigration...

163
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:29,560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In the Bureau of Immigration alone, we're looking at over 1.1, 1.2 billion, kasi nabanggit niyo po, IT system pa lang, 1 plus billion na po.

164
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:41,139
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, siguro po, Kom, with SEC, kasi it's going to be one, essentially one list coming from DOJ.

165
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:48,900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, when Sec gives the list to me for items for consideration,

166
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:55,740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ipa-prioritize na natin siya, Sec, among the different attached agencies within the DOJ.

167
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, we'll have to look through that later on.

168
00:11:58,754 --> 00:11:59,074
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes, Your Honor.

169
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:04,380
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We'll gladly submit that wish list with the corresponding order of prioritization.

170
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:09,320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And we will do the proper consultation with the various agencies here.

171
00:12:09,487 --> 00:12:09,960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes, po.

172
00:12:10,079 --> 00:12:19,459
